../items/thm-analytic-primary-matrix-function-jordan-contour-agreement.md:74:[F4] For a null-homologous cycle, the higher Cauchy formula is $n(\Gamma,z)f^{(k)}(z)=\frac{k!}{2\pi i}\int_\Gamma f(\zeta)(\zeta-z)^{-k-1}\,d\zeta$ ([[cor-global-cauchy-formula-higher-derivatives]]); the chain integral is the finite sum of its contour integrals ([[def-integration-and-index-of-complex-chain]]).
