+    - title: 'Ivano Basile, Luca Buoninfante, Francesco Di Filippo, Benjamin Knorr, Alessia Platania, and Anna Tokareva, Lectures in Quantum Gravity'
+      url: https://arxiv.org/pdf/2412.08690.pdf
